5. ENGINE UNIFICATION CONTRACT

All engines MUST implement:

interface Engine {
  load(romBuffer)
  start()
  stop()
  step(frameTime)
  sendInput(input)
  saveState()
  loadState(state)
}

RULE:

no engine can break this contract

adapters enforce compliance only



